{"type":"message","id":"2928086e","parentId":"d262c6a6","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:27:05.972Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I now have a clear picture:\n\n1. The build directory has test meshes (pipe.cgns, decomposed_mesh_*.cgns)\n2. There's a pipe.yaml configuration file for CFD testing\n3. The workflow is:\n   - `./cutter.exe -m pipe.cgns -np 4` to partition\n   - `/home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml` to test\n\nLet me wait for the search-agent and design-agent results. They should auto-announce when done.\n\nIn the meantime, let me prepare the coordination plan and check if there's any existing optimization history.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我检查是否有之前的优化记录："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-13f97d338c434b7a8e4dd17442948d46","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw-reports/ 2>/dev/null || mkdir -p /home/one/.openclaw-reports && echo \"Created reports directory\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-f5cd548b32e143d8abbdaacf5f3a679d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter -name \"*.md\" -o -name \"TODO*\" -o -name \"CHANGELOG*\" 2>/dev/null | head -10"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":35000,"output":368,"cacheRead":1535,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620009673}}
