{"type":"message","id":"fb4e8fc3","parentId":"126202ab","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:27:59.683Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我对项目状态有了清晰的理解：\n\n## 已完成的优化\n\n### P0-1: `distribute()` 负载均衡 ✅\n- 已修复：使用向下取整 + 余数均匀分配\n- 代码：`base = len / n; remainder = len % n;`\n\n### P1-3: Interface 数据结构优化 ✅\n- 已修复：`outerFace_` 从 `map<string, ...>` 改为 `unordered_map<size_t, ...>`\n- 添加了 `hashFace()` 函数\n\n### P0-2: Interface 通信优化 ⚠️ 部分完成\n- 当前代码使用了点对点通信\n- 但仍使用字符串序列化\n\n根据最新审查报告 (2026-03-04-parmetis-optimization.md)，还有一些待完成的工作：\n\n1. **collect_interface() 的字符串序列化** - 仍使用字符串拼接方式\n2. **distribute() 的实际效果** - 需要验证是否真正均衡\n\n让我继续检查 collect_interface() 的当前实现：","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我检查当前 `collect_interface()` 的实现状态："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-88f33e52f8d146f89bb241f78ae33bac","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","offset":73,"limit":80}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":527,"output":496,"cacheRead":41919,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42942,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620063709}}
{"type":"message","id":"2e09700c","parentId":"fb4e8fc3","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:27:59.690Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-88f33e52f8d146f89bb241f78ae33bac","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n    // Unpack received interface data\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const std::string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            if (ifile.empty()) continue;\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            if (cur.size() < 2) continue;\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto faceHash : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { \n                if (!faceHash.empty()) {\n                    nbrOuterface.insert({std::stoull(faceHash), {}});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    std::string sendTmp = packInterface();\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n\n    // Step 1: Determine which ranks have data to send (non-empty send buffer)\n    std::vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, 0);\n    sendCnts[RANK] = sendCnt;\n    MPI_Allgather(&sendCnt, 1, MPI_INT, sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Step 2: Identify target ranks (those with non-empty data)\n    std::vector<int> targetRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            targetRanks.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Step 3: Use point-to-point communication only with target ranks\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<int> recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n    std::vector<std::string> recvBuffers(SIZE);\n    std::vector<char*> recvBuffersPtr(SIZE, nullptr);\n\n    // Post non-blocking receives from all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            recvCnt[i] = sendCnts[i];\n            recvBuffers[i].assign(recvCnt[i] + 1, '\\0');\n            recvBuffersPtr[i] = const_cast<char*>(recvBuffers[i].data());\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Post non-blocking sends to all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[RANK] > 0) {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Isend(const_cast<char*>(sendTmp.data()), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    if (!requests.empty()) {\n        std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n        MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Process received data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0 && !recvBuffers[i].empty()) {\n            unpackInterface(recvBuffers[i]);\n        }\n    }\n\n[584 more lines in file. Use offset=153 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620079688}}
{"type":"message","id":"f6a0c7ea","parentId":"2e09700c","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:28:18.268Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"根据之前的优化报告和当前代码，我发现：\n\n**已完成的优化：**\n1. ✅ P0-1: `distribute()` 已修复，使用向下取整+余数均匀分配\n2. ✅ P1-3: `outerFace_` 已改为 `unordered_map<size_t, ...>` 使用 hash key\n3. ✅ P0-2: `collect_interface()` 已从全量 Alltoallv 改为点对点通信\n\n**但仍有优化空间：**\n- `collect_interface()` 中仍使用字符串序列化（packInterface 使用字符串拼接）\n- unpackInterface 仍使用 stringSplit 字符串分割\n\n根据 review-agent 的最新报告（2026-03-04-parmetis-optimization.md），还有一些问题需要处理。\n\n让我继续等待 search-agent 和 design-agent 的结果，然后制定下一步计划。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在我已经了解了当前代码状态。根据之前的优化历史：\n\n**已完成的优化：**\n1. ✅ P0-1: `distribute()` 负载均衡已修复\n2. ✅ P0-2: `collect_interface()` 已改为点对点稀疏通信\n3. ✅ P1-3: `outerFace_` 已改用 hash key\n\n**仍需优化：**\n- 字符串序列化效率仍可进一步优化\n- 需要验证性能提升\n\n让我等待 search-agent 和 design-agent 的结果，然后决定是否需要进一步优化："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-3d41db70db1e43b58e63746983dbf112","name":"subagents","arguments":{"action":"list"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":934,"output":493,"cacheRead":42367,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43794,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620079691}}
