{"type":"message","id":"a78e7623","parentId":"4e73d42b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:37:31.901Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-c8d0c26b12324fdfb93c3aae9fd27a1c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <vector>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// ============================================================================\n// Binary message format for interface data serialization\n// ============================================================================\n#pragma pack(push, 1)\nstruct InterfaceMessageHeader {\n    uint32_t magic;       // Magic number: 0x494E5446 (\"INTF\")\n    uint16_t version;     // Version: 0x0001\n    uint16_t flags;       // Reserved flags\n    uint32_t entry_count; // Number of file entries\n    uint32_t reserved;    // Reserved for alignment (total 16 bytes)\n};\n\nstruct InterfaceEntryHeader {\n    int32_t  file_id;     // File ID (key in outerFace_)\n    uint32_t face_count;  // Number of face hashes\n    // Followed by face_count * uint64_t (face hash values)\n};\n#pragma pack(pop)\n\n// Magic number constant\nconstexpr uint32_t INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC = 0x494E5446; // \"INTF\"\nconstexpr uint16_t INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION = 0x0001;\n\n// Hash function for face (vector of cgsize_t)\ninline size_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    for (auto id : face)\n        h ^= std::hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}\n\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nclass MetisCutter : public MeshCutter\n{\npublic:\n    MetisCutter();\n    virtual ~MetisCutter();\n\npublic:\n    void cut(int argc, char** argv) override;\n\nprivate:\n    using cgns_filetype = std::shared_ptr<CGFile>;\n    int RANK = 0, SIZE = 1;\n    cgns_filetype bigMesh_;\n    vector<cgns_filetype> smallMesh_;\n    map<int, map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t>> nodeIdG2L_;\n    set<cgsize_t> nodeIds_, cellIds_;\n    vector<idx_t> cellPartition_, nodePartition_;\n    unordered_map<int, unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n    cgsize_t globalOffset_ = 0;\n    set<int> ownerFile_;\n    struct DecomposeResult\n    {\n        idx_t nCellThisRank, start;\n    };\n    struct Cell\n\n[47 more lines in file. Use offset=81 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620651899}}
{"type":"message","id":"7dd41949","parentId":"a78e7623","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:42:44.854Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"code-agent 已完成二进制序列化优化实现。现在我需要：\n1. 读取 code-agent 的报告了解具体实现\n2. 验证编译是否成功\n3. 启动 test-agent 进行测试\n4. 如果测试通过，启动 review-agent 进行代码审查\n\n让我先读取 code-agent 的报告。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"code-agent 已完成二进制序列化优化！让我检查实现结果并启动测试验证。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-5226901ebeb34bb88627913cdebc5098","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/2026-03-04-binary-serialization.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":3704,"output":184,"cacheRead":68799,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72687,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620651901}}
{"type":"message","id":"fce70366","parentId":"7dd41949","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:42:44.860Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-5226901ebeb34bb88627913cdebc5098","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Development Report\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-04\n**Task:** 实现二进制序列化优化 collect_interface()\n**Agent:** code-agent\n\n## Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n\n## Files Changed\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `src/metisCutter.h` | 添加二进制消息格式定义和函数声明 |\n| `src/metisCutter.cpp` | 实现二进制序列化/反序列化函数，更新 collect_interface() |\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### 二进制消息格式\n定义了紧凑的二进制消息格式：\n- `InterfaceMessageHeader` (16 字节): 魔数、版本、entry 计数\n- `InterfaceEntryHeader` (8 字节): file_id + face_count\n- 后跟 face_count 个 uint64_t 哈希值\n\n### 主要改动\n\n1. **metisCutter.h**:\n   - 添加 `#include <cstdint>` 和 `#include <vector>`\n   - 定义 `InterfaceMessageHeader` 和 `InterfaceEntryHeader` 结构体\n   - 定义魔数常量 `INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC` 和版本号 `INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION`\n   - 添加 `packInterfaceBinary()` 和 `unpackInterfaceBinary()` 函数声明\n\n2. **metisCutter.cpp**:\n   - 实现 `packInterfaceBinary()`: 计算 buffer 大小，直接写入二进制数据\n   - 实现 `unpackInterfaceBinary()`: 验证魔数和版本，解析二进制数据\n   - 更新 `collect_interface()`: 使用 `std::vector<char>` 替代 `std::string`，调用二进制函数\n\n### 性能优化点\n- **消除字符串拼接**: 不再需要 `std::to_string()` 转换\n- **消除字符串分割**: 不再需要 `stringSplit()` 操作\n- **消除类型转换**: 直接内存拷贝，无需 `std::stoi()`/`std::stoull()`\n- **减少内存分配**: 单次预分配 buffer，而非多次字符串拼接\n\n### 边界情况处理\n- 空 `outerFace_` 数据: 返回仅含 header 的 buffer\n- 无效数据: 验证魔数和版本号\n- 截断数据: 检查 buffer 边界防止越界访问\n\n## Code Notes\n\n### 消息格式示例\n```\nHeader (16 bytes):\n  [magic:4][version:2][flags:2][entry_count:4][reserved:4]\n\nEntry 1:\n  [file_id:4][face_count:4][hash1:8][hash2:8]...[hashN:8]\n\nEntry 2:\n  ...\n```\n\n### 兼容性\n- 版本号机制支持未来格式扩展\n- 魔数验证防止数据损坏\n- 保持与原有点对点稀疏通信逻辑兼容\n\n## Known Limitations\n- 假设 `size_t` 与 `uint64_t` 兼容 (64位系统)\n- 假设 `int` 与 `int32_t` 兼容 (32位)\n- 未实现版本兼容性检查 (当前仅支持 v1)\n\n## Next Steps for Team\n- **test-agent:** 使用多进程测试验证二进制序列化正确性\n- **review-agent:** 检查边界条件和内存安全性\n- **perf-agent:** 对比字符串和二进制格式性能差异\n\n## Status\n✅ 编译通过，待运行测试"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620964858}}
