{"type":"message","id":"a11e8dc5","parentId":"fb32f14a","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:28.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"code-agent is investigating the parallel CFD segfault issue. Let me wait for its completion. Meanwhile, let me analyze the problem more carefully based on the test results.\n\nThe test showed:\n1. Mesh partitioning works - interface data is transmitted correctly (44521/44598 interfaces)\n2. Single-process CFD works - converges normally\n3. Parallel CFD fails with segfault\n\nThis suggests the issue is NOT in the interface data transmission itself, but somewhere else. The segfault happens \"after boundary generation\" according to the test report. This could be:\n1. Data format mismatch between what's expected by the CFD solver\n2. Missing data that the parallel solver needs\n3. Memory corruption somewhere\n\nLet me check if there's any obvious issue in the code by looking at what happens after collect_interface().","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我分析问题的可能原因："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-56add4ac5a864766a8e4324bc81d9318","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","limit":100,"offset":300}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":102725,"output":385,"cacheRead":3327,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106437,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621408246}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e7530fe","parentId":"a11e8dc5","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:28.027Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-56add4ac5a864766a8e4324bc81d9318","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        for (auto &jt : it) cellInfo[RANK].emplace_back(jt);\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::TypeFree(&cellType);\n\n    return cellInfo[RANK];\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_metis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // load body-data into memory from file\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList());\n\n    check(true, \"\", format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s\\n\", bigBody.name));\n    // cut\n    check(cut_metis(bigBody.data, (idx_t)np, cellPartition_, nodePartition_) == METIS_OK, format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s return error %s\", bigBody.name), format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s successfuly\\n\", bigBody.name));\n\n    // write sub-mesh data to file\n    for (auto ifile = 0; ifile < np; ++ifile)\n    {\n        // open sub-mesh to write\n        this->openSubMeshToWrite(meshFilename, ifile, np);\n\n        // collect cell/node id of sub-mesh\n        nodeIdG2L_.insert({ifile, {}}); // 1-base id\n        nodeIds_.clear();               // 1-base id\n        cellIds_.clear();               // 0-base id\n        for (auto i = 0; i < cellPartition_.size(); ++i)\n        {\n            if (cellPartition_[i] != ifile) continue;\n\n            cellIds_.insert(i + 1);\n            for (auto it : bigBody.cell(i + 1))\n                if (nodeIds_.count(it) == 0) nodeIds_.insert(it);\n        }\n        for (auto it : nodeIds_) nodeIdG2L_[ifile].insert({it, nodeIdG2L_[ifile].size() + 1});\n\n        // write coordinate\n        this->rwNode(ifile);\n\n        // write body-section\n        this->rwBody(ifile, bigBody);\n\n        // write bdy-section\n        this->rwBoundary(ifile);\n\n        // write interface\n        this->rwInterface(ifile);\n\n        // clear\n        for (auto i = 0; i <= ifile; ++i)\n        {\n            if (outerFace_[i].empty())\n            {\n                nodeIdG2L_[i].clear();\n                smallMesh_[i]->close();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // clear\n    bigMesh_->close();\n    bigBody.clear();\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_parmetis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    RANK = MPIAdapter::rank(), SIZE = MPIAdapter::size();\n\n    if (SIZE > np)\n    {\n        if (MPIAdapter::isMaster()) check(true, \"\", format(\"MPI size should not bigger than subMesh number: %d > %d\\n\", SIZE, np));\n\n        MPIAdapter::Finalize();\n        exit(EXIT_SUCCESS);\n    }\n\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // handle bodysection\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->bodySection();\n\n    // decompose body-section into np parts,\n    // and collect subBody belong to each process\n    auto comPartId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.partId < rhs.partId; };\n    auto comId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.id < rhs.id; };\n    auto subBody = collect_subBody(this->decompose_body(bigBody, np), ownerThread_);\n    if (subBody.size() == 0) std::cout << format(\"Thread %d has no subBody\\n\", RANK);\n    std::sort(subBody.begin(), subBody.end(), comPartId);\n    auto pos = subBody.begin();\n    while (pos != subBody.end())\n    {\n        // relod body-section\n        auto lastPos = pos;\n        const auto ifile = lastPos->partId;\n\n[417 more lines in file. Use offset=400 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772621428023}}
