{"type":"message","id":"6c2785eb","parentId":"39e6f573","timestamp":"2026-03-04T11:05:26.593Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-2fd0c222ce1a4eee9804d33c2c767760","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 测试报告\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-04\n**Task:** 验证二进制序列化修复\n**Agent:** test-agent\n\n## Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n\n## Instructions Source\n- [x] Leader-agent task\n\n---\n\n## 编译测试\n- **状态:** ✅ 成功\n- **Details:** cmake .. && make -j4 完成，所有 target 构建成功\n\n```\n[100%] Built target cutter.exe\n```\n\n---\n\n## 剖分测试\n- **状态:** ✅ 成功\n- **输出文件:** decomposed_mesh_0.cgns, decomposed_mesh_1.cgns\n- **接口数据:** \n  - Thread 0: recv 79 interface of file 1\n  - Thread 1: recv 79 interface of file 0\n\n```\n  decomposed_mesh_0.cgns: write section SOLID_1_1_SOLID [7900: 1, 7900]\n  decomposed_mesh_1.cgns: write section SOLID_1_1_SOLID [7900: 1, 7900]\n  decomposed_mesh_0.cgns: write section Interface_1 [79: 10780, 10858]\n  decomposed_mesh_1.cgns: write section Interface_0 [79: 10780, 10858]\n```\n\n---\n\n## CFD 验证\n\n### 单进程测试\n- **状态:** ✅ 成功\n- **残差收敛:** \n  - 初始: momentumEquationU ~0.03, pressurecorrectionEquation ~0.05\n  - 最终: momentumEquationU ~9e-7, pressurecorrectionEquation ~6.8e-7\n- **退出码:** 0\n\n### 并行测试 (mpirun -n 2) ⭐ 关键测试\n- **状态:** ✅ 成功\n- **残差收敛:**\n  - 初始: momentumEquationU ~0.006, pressurecorrectionEquation ~0.03\n  - 最终: momentumEquationU ~7e-7, pressurecorrectionEquation ~9e-7\n- **退出码:** 0\n- **备注:** 之前失败的 MPI 通信问题已修复，双进程并行计算正常收敛\n\n```\n[Process 0] In SubIteration No.  134 of 200\nmomentumEquationU residual = 7.17977e-07\nmomentumEquationV residual = 5.13131e-07\nmomentumEquationW residual = 1.93415e-08\npressurecorrectionEquation residual = 9.06798e-07\n\nProcess exited with code 0.\n```\n\n---\n\n## 结论\n\n| 测试项 | 预期 | 实际 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| 编译 | 成功 | 成功 | ✅ Pass |\n| 网格剖分 | 生成 decomposed_mesh_*.cgns | 已生成 | ✅ Pass |\n| 单进程 CFD | 收敛 | 残差收敛至 ~1e-6 | ✅ Pass |\n| 并行 CFD | 收敛 | 残差收敛至 ~1e-6 | ✅ Pass |\n\n**总体:** ✅ **通过**\n\n---\n\n## 技术摘要\n\n修复前的问题：\n1. MPI TAG 匹配问题\n2. MPI 缓冲区大小问题  \n3. MPI 错误处理缺失\n\n修复后验证：\n- 网格剖分工具 cutter.exe 正确生成分区网格\n- 接口数据正确交换（79 个 interface 节点）\n- 并行 CFD 求解器正常收敛，无 MPI 错误\n\n---\n\n## 下一步建议\n\n- [x] 测试完成，可部署到生产环境\n- [ ] 建议增加更多测试用例（如 4 进程并行测试）\n- [ ] 建议将此测试添加到 CI/CD 流程"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772622326581}}
